OL,3,GNEWSAClass action bid for compensation
OL,4,Aafter law firm collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawyers are preparing a class
OL,7,Faction-style lawsuit after a law firm
OL,8,Fwith thousands of clients across the UK
OL,9,Fwent bust.
OL,11,FMcClure Solicitors, which was founded
OL,12,Fin Greenock, specialised in work such
OL,13,Fas wills and trusts. It went into
OL,14,Fadministration in 2021.
OL,16,FFormer clients, who have paid thousands
OL,17,Fof pounds in fresh legal fees following
OL,18,Fthe firm's collapse, have described it
OL,19,Fas a scandal.
