OL,3,GNEWSAClass action bid for compensation
OL,4,Aafter law firm collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaw firm Addleshaw Goddard is now
OL,7,Fplanning to raise group proceedings at
OL,8,FScotland's highest civil court with the
OL,9,Faim of securing compensation for
OL,10,Feligible clients.
